abstract: >-
  Code, tests, campaign evidence tables, rule files and paper sources accompanying the
  companion paper "Zero Without Stasis: Organisational Emergence in an Exactly Reversible
  Signed-Charge-Conserving Block Cellular Automaton". The software is MIT-licensed; the
  manuscript, supplement and figures are released under CC BY 4.0. Large trajectories,
  checkpoints and full-resolution state arrays are retained by the author and are not
  part of this release.
